# al6xxx ontology v0.1.0 — links to external ontologies. skos matches only (no owl:imports),
# so external versions can change without changing what our own data means.
# Checked 2026-09-25:
#   TTO v2.0.1 (PMD Tensile Test Ontology, CC BY 4.0), https://github.com/materialdigital/application-ontologies
#     commit a4740da, tensile_test_ontology_TTO/pmd_tto.ttl
#   QUDT schema http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/
#   Not linked: PMD Heat Treatment Ontology (HTO v2.0) models furnaces and quench equipment, not ageing steps.

@prefix al:   <https://w3id.org/al6xxx#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix tto:  <https://w3id.org/pmd/tto/> .
@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .

al:UTS skos:closeMatch tto:TensileStrength .
al:YTS skos:closeMatch tto:YieldStrength , tto:Rp02 .
al:EL  skos:closeMatch tto:PercentageElongationAfterFracture .
al:PropertyValue skos:closeMatch qudt:QuantityValue .
